      "widgets_values": [
        "Subtle Edit, Krea 2 (krea2edit LoRAs by Locke)\n\n- encode_res = Locke's grounding_px (longest side), 768 default.\n- ref_boost 4 = Locke's example workflow; optimal value is LoRA-specific. boost_mask limits it to a region.\n- Person into scene: image_1 = scene (aligned), image_2 = person (ref_position_2 beside).\n- Generate at image_1's size (latent from the scaled image): that matches Locke's fit path.\n- Turbo: 10 steps, CFG 1 (negative unused). Raw: more steps and CFG > 1, negative is used.\n- Second reference: image_2 on both encoders (frame 2)."
      ]
